language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Balanced incomplete block design with v objects, b blocks, block size k, replication r and pair count l, given as a v by b incidence matrix.
given v : int
given b : int
given r : int
given k : int
given l : int
$ incidence matrix: matrix_[i,j] is true when object i is in block j
find matrix_ : matrix indexed by [int(1..v), int(1..b)] of bool
branching on [matrix_]
such that
$ each object occurs in exactly r blocks
forAll i : int(1..v) . ((sum j : int(1..b) . toInt(matrix_[i,j])) = r),
$ each block contains exactly k distinct objects
forAll j : int(1..b) . ((sum i : int(1..v) . toInt(matrix_[i,j])) = k),
$ every two distinct objects occur together in exactly l blocks
forAll i : int(1..v) . forAll i2 : int(1..v) . (i < i2) -> ((sum j : int(1..b) . toInt(matrix_[i,j]) * toInt(matrix_[i2,j])) = l)
